; The first step of a frame's level: what multiplies the gain. Per segment five cards in (kind, n, adjv, prevv,
; nextv); per frame snd and V (INP at gs, gv); per frame two out, a mode and a factor for mulx. A silent frame: mode
; 3 (A is 0). A sonorant: mode 1 and the loudness (LOUD, from the table, OUT at ask) of its vowel: the vowel after
; it if one comes right after, else the vowel before it, else AX; aspirated (V 0), the next vowel anywhere. Anything
; else: mode 0.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            seg     INP   kind     03-11: a segment (i counts its frames down)
  04                    INP   i
  05                    INP   adjv
  06                    INP   prevv
  07                    INP   nextv
  08            frm     CLA   i
  09                    SUB   00
  10                    TAC   seg
  11                    STO   i
  12            gs      INP   snd      12-30: a frame: silent, a sonorant, or neither
  13            gv      INP   v
  14                    CLA   z
  15                    STO   y
  16                    STO   mode
  17                    CLA   snd
  18                    SUB   00
  19                    TAC   sil
  20                    SUB   00
  21                    TAC   snd1
  22            sil     CLA   n3
  23                    STO   mode
  24                    JMP   out
  25            snd1    CLA   kind
  26                    SUB   n2
  27                    TAC   out
  28                    SUB   00
  29                    TAC   son
  30                    JMP   out
  31            son     CLA   nextv    31-54: the sonorant's vowel and its loudness
  32                    STO   r
  33                    CLA   v
  34                    SUB   00
  35                    TAC   ask
  36                    CLA   adjv
  37                    STO   r
  38                    SUB   00
  39                    TAC   tp
  40                    JMP   ask
  41            tp      CLA   prevv
  42                    STO   r
  43                    SUB   00
  44                    TAC   tax
  45                    JMP   ask
  46            tax     CLA   cax
  47                    STO   r
  48            ask     OUT   r
  49            gl      INP   y
  50                    CLA   00
  51                    STO   mode
  52            out     OUT   mode
  53                    OUT   y
  54                    JMP   frm
  60            kind    DATA  0
  61            i       DATA  0
  62            adjv    DATA  0
  63            prevv   DATA  0
  64            nextv   DATA  0
  65            snd     DATA  0
  66            v       DATA  0
  67            y       DATA  0
  68            mode    DATA  0
  69            r       DATA  0
  70            z       DATA  0
  71            n2      DATA  2
  72            n3      DATA  3
  73            cax     DATA  18
